{"accountName": "安全分析与研究", "author": "安全分析与研究", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "原创 pandazhengzheng 2026-11-14 22:00 广东", "type": "p"}, {"text": "目录", "type": "h"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/M5H82XuSHY7FAAF0mgyFLAHPccYQNhiadYR9R0c5dyL4xHTsFhTEibKVib2mNbictVI4cDKqwZSkfIvTWlm1JbDw7ZxYCgDkmFNxnj8LLrt6YiaQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "引言：多 Agent 信任问题", "type": "p"}, {"text": "威胁模型", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Agent 身份与证书体系", "type": "p"}, {"text": "双向认证与 mTLS", "type": "p"}, {"text": "持续验证机制", "type": "p"}, {"text": "零信任策略引擎", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Agent 服务网格", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跨信任域联邦", "type": "p"}, {"text": "评估框架", "type": "p"}, {"text": "前沿挑战", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1. 引言：多 Agent 信任问题", "type": "h"}, {"text": "多 Agent 系统中 Agent 间通信面临多重威胁：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "威胁", "type": "p"}, {"text": "描述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "后果", "type": "p"}, {"text": "冒充", "type": "p"}, {"text": "攻击者伪造 Agent 身份", "type": "p"}, {"text": "未授权访问", "type": "p"}, {"text": "中间人", "type": "p"}, {"text": "窃听/篡改 Agent 间通信", "type": "p"}, {"text": "数据泄露/注入", "type": "p"}, {"text": "被攻陷 Agent", "type": "p"}, {"text": "持有合法证书但行为恶意", "type": "p"}, {"text": "内部攻击", "type": "p"}, {"text": "证书滥用", "type": "p"}, {"text": "复制/重放合法证书", "type": "p"}, {"text": "身份盗用", "type": "p"}, {"text": "信任传递", "type": "p"}, {"text": "通过信任链过度获取权限", "type": "p"}, {"text": "权限蔓延", "type": "p"}, {"text": "零信任原则 ：永不信任，始终验证——每次 Agent 间请求都经过身份、上下文、行为风险评估。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2. 威胁模型", "type": "h"}, {"text": "攻击者能力 ：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "网络位置：可观察、拦截、注入 Agent 间通信", "type": "p"}, {"text": "身份：可能持有部分合法证书（被攻陷 Agent）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "计算：多项式时间", "type": "p"}, {"text": "限制：无法破解密码学原语，无法攻破硬件信任根", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全目标 ：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "认证性 ：通信双方确认为声称的 Agent", "type": "p"}, {"text": "机密性 ：通信内容仅双方可知", "type": "p"}, {"text": "完整性 ：通信内容未被篡改", "type": "p"}, {"text": "新鲜性 ：无重放攻击", "type": "p"}, {"text": "授权性 ：每次请求经权限检查", "type": "p"}, {"text": "持续验证 ：通信过程中持续验证身份与完整性", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3. Agent 身份与证书体系", "type": "h"}, {"text": "3.1 基于硬件信任根的身份", "type": "h"}, {"text": "信任根 ：TPM 2.0 / AMD SEV-SNP / Intel TDX 提供硬件级密钥保护。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Agent 身份生成 ：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1. 硬件信任根生成 Agent 专用密钥对 (pk_agent, sk_agent)    sk_agent 存储于 TPM 内，永不导出 2. CA 签发 Agent 身份证书：    Cert_agent = Sign_CA(pk_agent, {agent_id, capabilities, expiry, issuer}) 3. Agent 持有 Cert_agent，私钥永不离开 TPM", "type": "p"}, {"text": "证书内容 ：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "{ \"agent_id\" :  \"agent-uuid-xxx\" , \"public_key\" :  \"Ed25519:...\" , \"creator\" :  \"org-yyy\" , \"capabilities\" : [ \"read:db1\" ,  \"write:queue1\" ,  \"call:api_zzz\" ], \"trust_level\" :  \"verified\" , \"issued_at\" :  \"2026-09-10T00:00:00Z\" , \"expires_at\" :  \"2026-09-10T01:00:00Z\" , \"attestation\" : { \"tpm_quote\" :  \"...\" , \"measurement\" :  \"SHA256:...\"   } }", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3.2 远程证明", "type": "h"}, {"text": "远程证明 ：Agent 向对方证明其运行在可信执行环境（TEE）中，且代码度量值符合预期。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "协议 ：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Agent A → Agent B:   1. A 生成 nonce_A   2. TPM_A 生成 quote = Quote(nonce_A, measurement_A)   3. A 发送 (Cert_A, quote, nonce_A) → B Agent B 验证:   4. B 验证 Cert_A 的 CA 签名   5. B 验证 quote 的 TPM 签名   6. B 检查 measurement_A ∈ ExpectedMeasurements   7. B 生成 nonce_B, 发送 (Cert_B, quote_B, nonce_B) → A   8. 双方派生会话密钥 = KDF(nonce_A, nonce_B, ...)", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3.3 证书生命周期", "type": "h"}, {"text": "阶段", "type": "p"}, {"text": "操作", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全要求", "type": "p"}, {"text": "签发", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CA 签发证书", "type": "p"}, {"text": "身份验证、能力审核", "type": "p"}, {"text": "分发", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Agent 获取证书", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全通道、私钥不出 TEE", "type": "p"}, {"text": "使用", "type": "p"}, {"text": "出示证书认证", "type": "p"}, {"text": "每次通信出示", "type": "p"}, {"text": "轮换", "type": "p"}, {"text": "定期更新证书", "type": "p"}, {"text": "自动轮换、零停机", "type": "p"}, {"text": "吊销", "type": "p"}, {"text": "撤销被攻陷证书", "type": "p"}, {"text": "及时传播、OCSP/CRL", "type": "p"}, {"text": "归档", "type": "p"}, {"text": "保留审计记录", "type": "p"}, {"text": "防篡改存储", "type": "p"}, {"text": "短期证书 ：证书有效期 < 1 小时，减少吊销需求（过期即失效）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "4. 双向认证与 mTLS", "type": "h"}, {"text": "4.1 mTLS 通信", "type": "h"}, {"text": "Agent 间 mTLS 握手 ：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Agent A                          Agent B   |                                |   | ---- ClientHello(Cert_A) ----> |   |                                |   | |   |                                |   | ---- Finished(verify) -------> |   |                                |   | |", "type": "p"}, {"text": "证书钉扎 ：Agent 预配置信任的 CA/证书指纹，防止 CA 被攻陷后的中间人攻击。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "4.2 会话安全", "type": "h"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/M5H82XuSHY7FAAF0mgyFLAHPccYQNhiadYR9R0c5dyL4xHTsFhTEibKVib2mNbictVI4cDKqwZSkfIvTWlm1JbDw7ZxYCgDkmFNxnj8LLrt6YiaQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "11月14日", "id": "2859062548", "summary": "原创 pandazhengzheng 2026-11-14 22:00 广东 \n目录 \n引言：多 Agent 信任问题 \n威胁模型 \nAgent 身份与证书体系 \n双向认证与 mTLS \n持续验证机制 \n零信任策略引擎 \nAgent 服务网格 \n跨信任域联邦 \n评估框架 \n前沿挑战 \n参考文献 \n1. 引言：多 Agent 信任问题 \n多 Agent 系统中 Agent 间通信面临多重威胁： \n威", "title": "Agent双向认证与零信任", "ts": 1794664800000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4ODEyODA3MQ==&mid=2247497352&idx=1&sn=7230132b4a04bc970d8de3b406548f5b"}